"qDj" = (
/obj/structure/fluff/statue/knight/r{
	name = "statue of Ser Chudrick 'Westfallen'";
	desc = "A statue of an (in)famous Grenzelfhoftian Knight, Ser Chudrick 'Westfallen'. His peculiar name originating, if legend is to be believed from the decree of Grenzelhoftian Emperor Karlz-Joseph The Sixth, who, in a fit of mad fury decreed that the original name of Ser Chudrick's house be stricken from all Imperial records after the former had arrived at the Imperial Court, alone and battered, decrying only "MyLiege!Thewesthasfallen!" referring to the at-the-time struggle between Grenzel armies and a particularly powerful zizite cult. The Grenzel Emperor afterwards claimed this was a failure on Ser Chudrick's part, who was placed at the Helm of the Imperial Armies. Strangely it seems that the creator of this particular statue viewed Ser Chudrick in a rather positive light, with a small plaque at the base of the statue reading 'NOTHING EVER HAPPENS' - referencing the common sentiment amongst Grenzel peasantry that enjoyed their life under the protection of Ser Chudrick, many took to saying that 'Under Ser Chudrick's rule, Nothing (Bad) Ever Happens!'. Ser Chudrick remains a controversial figure amnogst historians and the knighthood to this dae, whether or not he was a failure of a commander, running on pure fortune, or rather a brave hero dealt a bad hand and punished for failing to achieve the impossible."
	},
/turf/open/floor/rogue/metal/barograte,
/area/rogue)
